quested-metadata/pi-generation-2026-10-07T00-26-14-425639Z.log`\n\nThe underlying metadata repair appears promising: `native-test-verify/pi.log` reports five missing FFM downcall registrations added and four native tests passing, while `dynamic-access-report/generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport-2026-10-07T00-21-08-394865Z.log` completed successfully with all 3 tracked calls covered. However, all three generation attempts were reverted; metrics record failure, 3 iterations, 0 generated LOC, and identical starting/ending commits.\n\nManual next steps:\n\n1. Fix or bypass `generateMetadata` so coordinate `1.5.7-18` resolves and uses the shared `1.5.2-5` test project.\n2. Reapply/review the attempted `ZstdInputStream` test refinement from the issue-requested-metadata logs and retain the generated FFM downcall metadata.\n3. Run the full coordinate-scoped metadata validation and JVM/native test lanes before preparing the repair PR.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0ff93d48ca168a39016ac5927291e087d09f5848512201b1d2\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 746, "output": 929, "cacheRead": 205568, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 472, "totalTokens": 207243, "cost": {"input": 0.0029839999999999997, "output": 0.018580000000000003, "cacheRead": 0.0822272, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.1037912}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1791332968564, "responseId": "resp_0ff93d48ca168a39016ac59269036887d0a0c3cab4ee01d71a", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
